window.products.push({"id":923138,"name":"Pepper Grinder or Salt Grinder, Coarseness Adjustable Pepper Mill Grinder, with Ceramic Precision Mechanism, Sea Salt Grinder or Pepper Grinder Refill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rcA+BV5SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique and Sustainable Each individual grinder is made from quality, sustainable grown plantation Natural Wood.Each set of grinders is consistent in size, dimensions and weight, however your set will boast its own unique wood grain, texture and quality finish. Sophisticated Look and Feel These quality salt and pepper grinders will proudly sit on display in your kitchen, on your counter top or the dining table. The smooth feel and natural wood grain appearance will enhance any dining setting. Fine or coarse grind-is it just a question of taste? Actually it depends on personal taste and the dish being prepared. While personal taste plays a role, some dishes call for coarse salt or pepper, whereas others require either or both to be finely ground. A finer grind will be used for a delicate sauce or mixed raw vegetables and a coarse grind for grilling a steak or when making heartier meats and dishes. How to use? To refill your salt and pepper grinders simply unscrew the silver top and remove the wooden lid. Top up your grinders with your choice of salt crystals and peppercorns and replace the wooden top and screw. Easy to Clean If you wish to clean the inside of the grinders we recommend using a small brush or an old tooth brush to brush down the internal walls. Package Included 1 x Salt or Pepper Grinder Please Note Separate all the part for cleaning is NOT recommended because some small component might be lost while washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rcA+BV5SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vedole","source_asin":"B09B3FQ2B9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B3FQ2B9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B3FQ2B9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":923139,"name":"OXO Good Grips Folding Clip Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714zTSI9jtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The oxo good grips folding clip dryer is a convenient way to air dry items that cannot be put in the dryer, such as underwear and lingerie. It's also strong enough to hang and dry heavier items such as jeans. The lightweight dryer uses three hooks to mount easily on a shower curtain rod or a rod in the laundry room. It features 14 clips with non-slip grips. The clips are attached directly to the rust proof aluminum rail. This provides easy access to the clip grips for fast opening and loading, and ensures the clips will not get tangled in storage. The dryer folds in half and snaps closed for compact storage and the folded dryer can be hung conveniently in a closet. This folding feature also allows the dryer to hang on curved or corner shower rods. The oxo good grips folding clip dryer is an ideal way to protect delicates, but is also great for reducing energy usage, cutting utility bill costs and extending the life of garments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714zTSI9jtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B007148MYE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923139","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007148MYE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007148MYE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
