window.products.push({"id":923316,"name":"NEXHOME PRO Boho Throw Pillow Covers for Couch Set of 2 20\"x20\", Handmade Decorative Linen Pillow Covers Summer for Bed, Sofa, Farmhouse Fringed Cushi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q4aeGSQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Linen 【Natural Linen Pillow Cover】Our pillow cover is made from 55% linen & 45% viscose. Linen is plant fiber, durable but no elasticity. Blend with viscose, give it stretchy. The pillow cover is natural and breathable, which helps to keep you cooler in the summer and toasty throughout the winter months. It is a great choice at all season and will keep softer after every wash. 【Low Saturation Pure Color, Simple Lifestyle】NEXHOME PRO this series couch pillow cover is designed with solid color. It is simple and elegant, has a warm soft feeling of quiet years, which coincides with the pursuit of a natural and minimalist lifestyle. Welcome to join us. 【Bohemian Style with Fringe at Edges】 Our boho pillow cover is design with fringes edge. The detail design of short tassels makes the pillow cover more unique, but not an exaggerated bohemian style. It is together farmhouse style with modern. Easy to match with others. 【2pc 20\"x20\" pillow covers, A Great Gift】: You can get 2pc 20\"x20\" pillow covers, insert not included. It is perfect for home decoration, you can put them on the sofa, bed, couch, chair and etc. Matches well with your furniture and bedding sets. Soft throw pillow is also a great gift idea for friends and family. 【Machine Washable, Easy to Care]: Our linen pillow cover is machine washable, wash separately on cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry on low or dry naturally, do not bleach. Warm iron when needed. When you wash it， recommended turn it from the outside to the inside to keep the fringe intact.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q4aeGSQuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEXHOME PRO","source_asin":"B0BKJP119V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKJP119V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKJP119V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":923317,"name":"IC Best Carved Horse Head Figurine Statue - Spirited Hand-Carved Wooden Sculpture, Great Gift for Dad and Other Horse Lovers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916SelI77+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 5\" x 4\" hand-carved horse head figurine is sculpted by expert craftsmen skilled in the old Indian art. The statue is carved from the best wood, and is decorated with a beautifully detailed filigree work. This ornate piece of art is a natural gift for mom or anyone who loves the power, freedom and beauty of horses. Details from the Manufacturer: To carve this statue, the artist traces the design on the wood-piece using zinc stencil. The excess wood is taken off as multiple in-depth layers of art are created using various hand tools. This creates the apparent raised areas, or relief, evident in works of this nature. Usually the carving is in low relief (known as chilai). High relief is also done where the pattern is carved out deeper (known as takai). On some parts of the carving the relief is very deep, going all the way through the piece. This results in being able to see-through the craft. The finer details are placed in the carving using fine chisels. Finally, the piece is finished by sanding, polishing and varnishing. Indian Wood Jali Animals: To sculpt this Indian Jali animal, the desired animal structure is carved from wood using various hand-tools. Fine holes are then created in the structure using chisels and files. Through these holes another small animal figurine is carved inside the main animal structure. Finally, the piece is finely buffed and polished. The skilled artisans are able to create this unique horse head figurine from a single block of wood. there are no joints created anywhere in the sculpture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916SelI77+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IC Best","source_asin":"B07BW2VBLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BW2VBLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BW2VBLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
