window.products.push({"id":923444,"name":"Asiatic Craft Rustic Galvanized Metal Table Top Napkin Holder, Decorative Napkin Tray for Dining Table and Kitchen, Unique Tissue Dispenser for Bathro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LElGOAX9L._AC_SL1302_.jpg","description":"Napkin HolderA flat napkin holder makes it easy to grab a napkin when you need to wipe your face, protect your lap from dropped food, or soak up a spill. Place on the dining table, kitchen countertop, picnic blanket, coffee table, home bar, breakfast nook, or anywhere else you might need napkins. This galvanized napkin holder holds its own in windy outdoor conditions, making it the perfect addition to a picnic, cookout, barbecue, coffee break, or any other outdoor food gathering. Sturdy steel will not tip or shift, and the arm keeps your cocktail napkins in place. The arm smoothly slides upward, allowing you to remove a napkin or refill the stock. Durable construction ensures the napkin dispenser will last.Crafted with heavy-duty galvanized steel, our napkin holder is resilient enough for BBQs, picnics, and other outdoor gatherings which makes it more attractive and value for money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LElGOAX9L._AC_SL1302_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Asiatic Craft","source_asin":"B09JK47SKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JK47SKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JK47SKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":923445,"name":"Rae Dunn Shoe Bench Rack – Two Tier Shoe Storage and Display Cubby for Footwear, Clothing – Shoe Box Organizer for Closet, Bedroom or Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g05xRsH1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep all of your shoes in order. Throw out dusty old cardboard shoe boxes! The Metal and Wood Shoe Rack from Rae Dunn is the perfect storage solution for all of your designer shoes. It’s designed to fit all of your footwear with ease. Stable metal easily holds weight. Neatly store all of your footwear in your closet, foyer, entryway or bedroom. This case provides the perfect display and looks great in your home. Two interior shelves hold your shoes and the top provides additional storage. Maintain the quality of your favorite shoes with the help of this shoe rack. PRODUCT FEATURES: Dimensions: 17.7” x 31.5” x 11.8” Premium Quality metal2 Tier Two Shelves Stackable Sleek and Modern Look  Clear STYLISH FLOATING SHOE RACK The barely there look doesn’t take up too much visual space in your home is beautiful and simple. It seamlessly blends in with your home or office. Add it to your closet to create more organization. It’s elegant enough to put on display in your bedroom, living room and entryway. It holds sneakers, heels, sandals, slippers, loafers, flats and booties. This versatile container may also be suitable for storing other clothing and accessories like sweaters, scarves or hats. Getting dressed just got better! RAE DUNN California artist, ceramicist and author, Rae Dunn , finds beauty in simple shapes, imperfection and found objects. \"In my own way, I am driven to find the balance between expressing something that is deeply meaningful to me and creating a sense of joy that might quietly touch the lives of others.\" Rae's designs are known for their functionality, design and durability. Rae's signature font gives every item a personal touch and adds to the simple beauty of her designs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71g05xRsH1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rae Dunn","source_asin":"B084MNHTJD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923445","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084MNHTJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084MNHTJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
