window.products.push({"id":923501,"name":"Meat Thermometer Tovendor Digital Instant Read Food Thermometer with Dual Probe and Alarming Function, Oven Safe Cooking Thermometer with Backlight fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pdaibrt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description Have you ever dreamed about being able to monitor a chunk of protein “doing its thing” on the grill or in the smoker and being able to do other tasks at the same time? Well, our classic thermapen instant read thermometer allows you do just that, allowing you concentrate on other household chores or simply take a break without worrying if your roasted chicken is becoming overcooked.This electronic meat thermometer cooking must be an indispensable tool in your kitchen, not only for chef but also for family. With a simple and practical design, simple on/off button can be used immediately without calibration. Just press a button and the solid probe will pop up to quickly read the temperature.Meat thermometer with backlit LCD display,the digital reading is super easy to see. You don’t have squint to try to determine where exactly your temperature lands of measurement Celsius/Fahrenheit selector, temperature alarming ensure the perfect temp when you're grilling or cooking. Buy a thermometer, it is a sound investment in food safety. Don't rob yourself of making perfectly cooked meals any longer, and cook like a pro. Specifications: -Color:Red -Temperature measurement range: -50°C to 300°C (-58°F to 572°F) -Display resolution: 0.1°C/0.2°F -Accuracy: ±1°C( -2°F) at -20°C-150°C -Probe diameter: 3.5mm -Tip diameter: 1.7mm -Probe length: 120mm -Battery type: 3V CR2032 NOTE: 1.DO NOT LEAVE THE THERMOMETER IN THE OVEN WHITE COOKING (High temperature resistance 380℃) 2.DO NOT TOUCH HOT PROBE WITH BARE HANDS. 3.DO NOT LEAVE INSERTED IN EXTREMELY HOT FOODS OR LIQUIDS (ANYTHING OVER 572°F) FOR MORE THAN 1 MINUTE. Package 1*Food thermometer 1*304 stainless steel probe 1*CR2032 button battery 1*Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Pdaibrt2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tovendor","source_asin":"B08F7QM46C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923501","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F7QM46C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F7QM46C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
