window.products.push({"id":923537,"name":"JoyJolt Disney Mickey Mouse Squad Collection Tumblers. 15oz Stemless Wine Glasses Set of 4 Stemless Wine Glass Drinking Glasses. Disney Gifts, Disney ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aJHw9Sy3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Grab Your Squad and Join Mickey’s: Best friends stick together around good conversation and the “Squad” Glassware Set of Disney Glass Tumblers. This fun collectible set features Mickey Mouse and pals – Donald Duck, Pluto and Goofy in 4 large Disney Tumblers for Adults and Kids. Disney Collectibles for Adults and Kids: It’s a 15oz white stemless wine tumbler with a little extra height, so each glass is nice for big gin glasses, cognac glasses, brandy glass, lowball glasses for tequila, or any liquor glasses! And of course for the kiddos - water, juice or a Mickey Mocktail! No Spill Stemless Red Wine Glasses Set of 4: With their substantially weighted base Pluto can run rings around your fancy drink without worrying about accidental tip overs! And of course without a stem, they’re adult bar glasses AND multi-purpose, daily-use Disney kitchen glasses as well! Strong Glass Cups: Not every novelty wine cup is suited for everyday use but like all JoyJolt drinkware, these are durable and designed to be enjoyed every day. We use glass that’s made to toast, made to last and gets a hearty Super Cheers from Mickey! Unboxing Joy: These friend-filled glasses are part of the JoyJolt Disney Mickey Collection of glassware and glass set gift packs! Your stemless wine glasses set of 4, will arrive gift boxed with a 12 Month Guarantee so order your JoyJolt Disney tumbler set now and drink for Joy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aJHw9Sy3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JoyJolt","source_asin":"B09T77P5SX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T77P5SX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T77P5SX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
