window.products.push({"id":923638,"name":"Ritzenhoff Mr. Salt & Pepper Salt Cellar and Pepper Pot, Angela Schiewer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AqD9LxLdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"More than 280 designers from all over the world work for Ritzenhoff - architects, designers and artists along with comic illustrators, advertisers, illustrators, interior designers, set designers and sculptors. They all contribute their own style and differing working methods to an endless variety of ideas - thus Ritzenhoff has created a minor encyclopedia of contemporary design on glass. What would a festive table, a romantic rendezvous, an opulent breakfast be without a decisive pinch of additional taste? Culture at the table has therefore created little helpers that are always at hand with a good sprinkling and patiently wait at the side of the plate. Mr. Salt and Mrs. Pepper perhaps put us in mind of their eager colleagues, they are quite allowed to show character and make us smile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AqD9LxLdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ritzenhoff","source_asin":"B005IF5WSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923638","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005IF5WSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005IF5WSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
