window.products.push({"id":923685,"name":"EarBliss Memory Foam Pillow with Ear Holes - Designed for Ear Comfort - Sleep Comfortably on Your Side with Earpods, Earrings, Piercings, CNH","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VN5qdfz2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED FOR EAR COMFORT - The EarBliss pillow by Soli was designed from scratch with your comfort in mind. Its unique ear holes are thoughtfully shaped and sized and strategically positioned to eliminate pressure on the ear lobe during side sleeping. Finally, you can sleep comfortably on your side with earbuds, earrings, or ear piercings. The EarBliss pillow is also ideal for painful conditions, such as CNH, allowing the earlobe to rest and recover, free from pressure or friction. SLEEP COMFORTABLY IN ANY POSITION - Every contour of the EarBliss pillow was thoughtfully created to provide optimal head and cervical spine support in any sleeping position. Enjoy comfortable support, whether you are a side sleeper or back sleeper. PREMIUM, FIRM MEMORY FOAM - Our pillow is made of safe, odorless, slow-recovery, firm memory foam for excellent head and neck support. If you prefer pillows that are very soft, this pillow is not for you - you will find it too firm. The open cell nature of our memory foam and our breathable pillow case fabric permit air flow and ventilation, resulting in cooling and increased sleep comfort. ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT - A 1 inch removable memory foam spacer is included, allowing you to customize the height of your pillow for increased comfort, as needed. Most users should remove the 1 inch included spacer for optimal comfort. Users with broad shoulders or large frames may use the pillow as is. To remove the spacer, simply unzip the pillow's cover and pull the spacer out. Replacing the spacer is just as easy - simply reverse the above steps. REMOVABLE, WASHABLE COVER - The EarBliss pillow comes with a beautiful, soft, breathable cover. The cover is easy to remove, should it require cleaning. Simply unzip and remove. The cover is machine-washable and easy to care for. Additional, custom removable protector covers are avalable for purchase (sold separately).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VN5qdfz2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soli","source_asin":"B0BHBBD6MT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923685","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHBBD6MT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHBBD6MT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":923686,"name":"Polish Pottery Bubble Mug 16 oz Water Tulip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.17,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fzaCWtvXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polish Pottery oz Bubble Mug made by Ceramika Artystyczna, Water Tulip Theme Certificate of Authenticity and origin is included Dimensions: 4.09\" high, 3.94\" wide, 5.47\" long, (max. outside edge or handle) Capacity: 16oz (filled to the rim) Polmedia Polish Pottery Stoneware is: * Hand crafted and hand painted in Boleslawiec, Poland * Microwave safe, dishwasher safe, oven safe up to 480 F, freezer safe * Lead and cadmium free * Crack and chip resistant * Intended for everyday use, easy to clean * Highly collectable About Polish Pottery Polish pottery is known for its versatility in the kitchen and on the table. It is safe for use with food in the microwave, freezer, oven and dishwasher. Polish stoneware is resilient to abrasives making it durable and resistant to scratching or chipping. It distributes heat evenly for perfect baking and is also nonstick for easy clean-up, making it easy to care for. The bright patterns never fade, and are offered in thousands of variations to mix and match. It is this combination of function and beauty that makes Polish pottery so appealing. The pottery is fired in electric and gas kilns at temperatures exceeding 2200 degrees Fahrenheit. This results in a stoneware that is meant to resist aging and provide lasting beauty that stands the test of time. Polish stoneware is lead and cadmium free.Polish Pottery is hand crafted and hand painted in the Boleslawiec region of Poland. This region is famous for its naturally found white clay which artisans have used for centuries to craft this durable and beautiful stoneware. Each piece of pottery is carefully formed and painted by hand to ensure that exceptional attention to detail is paid to each piece. The most beautiful and intricate patterns are called UNIKAT patterns. These patterns bear the artist’s signature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fzaCWtvXL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polmedia Polish Pottery","source_asin":"B01LY7WD2J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923686","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LY7WD2J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LY7WD2J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
