window.products.push({"id":923737,"name":"TravelMate Car Neck Pillow (Soft Version)- Neck Pillow; Car Pillow; Memory Foam Neck Pillow; Neck Rest Pillow; Car Neck Pillow (Color: Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.65,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91w8Sj5-OmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Driving for extended period of time can create additional strain on the neck, spine, muscles, and tendons – which can cause pain and discomfort. The TravelMate car neck pillow is designed to give you the support you lack with the factory installed headrest. It provides additional support for your neck and head and helps improve posture while driving, reducing muscle tension and stress. Made from high-quality memory foam, it molds to your neck and head perfectly to give you just the right amount of cushion for extra comfort, which makes daily commute or long distance driving far more enjoyable. The built-in elastic strap allows you to adjust the position on the car's original headrest for a custom fit. The compact design makes it easy to carry and store. If you ever want to stop at a rest area along the freeway and take a nap to relax during a long car trip, you would know that the factory installed headrest isn't really ideal for that application. In fact, it is quite uncomfortable. The solution? Just attach our pillow onto the default headrest and adjust your seat to a reclined position, you will be surprised how much more comfortable you can be! Once you have experienced the added support and comfort of our car neck pad, you will never take a long car trip without it. In your next long trip, have a few in your car prepared for other family members and they will thank you for your kind considerations. The pillow can also be used for extra support for your neck and head when you sit on a recliner at home. Maintaining spine alignment is vital for reducing joint and muscle discomfort while you drive. Our car neck rest is a patented device engineered to help keep your spine, neck, and head straight. The plush velour cover is removable and machine-washable. If you are not completely satisfied with the product, you can return it in 30 days for a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91w8Sj5-OmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TravelMate","source_asin":"B00A7ZV0R0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A7ZV0R0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A7ZV0R0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
