window.products.push({"id":923790,"name":"Goplus 5ft Pre-lit Artificial Christmas Tree, Hinged Fir Pencil Christmas Tree with 150 LED Lights, Perfect Xmas Decoration for Indoor and Outdoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JBAeHgGJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Feel the Warm Brilliant Lights】There are 150 pre-stung warm white LED lights on the Christmas tree, which give birth to a fairly tale mood, beautiful like the stars. Bright Christmas lights make the whole night become extremely warm. By the way, the UL-listed LED lights leave you no worry about using safety so that you can appreciate and enjoy it at ease. 【Slim Lifelike Pencil Design】Unique pencil Christmas tree molded from real tree, of which all green color is full of life, makes it hard for you to distinguish between real and artificial one. 300 Branch tips showcase lush look, which are delicately crafted from 100% new PVC material, no odor, non flammable, non allergic and non deformation as well. 【Keep the Tree Stand Straightly】It comes with an ultra sturdy metal stand, intended to keep the Christmas tree in an upright position all season long. Compared with plastic stand, the metal one, needless to say, is superior in every way, no matter lasting durability or great stability. Meanwhile, the plastic tips of the stand can also protect you floor from scratches. 【Easy to Set up with Less Effort】The pencil Christmas tree consists of hinged sections, features super easy assembly as well as disassembly and requires you less effort to build. The day after the Christmas ends, you can store the hinged sections and folded stand together, and reuse them the next holiday. 【Fantastic Decoration in Corner】Whether being placed next to the fire place or any corner in your house, the pre-lit Christmas tree will be a perfect decoration and takes up less floor. It will enchant your family and friends, while spreading the Christmas spirit to let you get into such joyful atmosphere, share happiness and bless good luck.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JBAeHgGJL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goplus","source_asin":"B08H578MK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H578MK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H578MK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
