window.products.push({"id":923820,"name":"glo Organic Stripe (Plum)-Wash Cloth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rhGXOTAZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Complete your bathing experience with the soft embrace of our Organic Towel Collection. Featuring glo's signature towels in a horizontal striped pattern in 6 sophisticated hues, these medium weight 550 gsm towels are luxuriously soft and eco-friendly to wash and dry. Natural, White, Mushroom, Faded Denim, Jade, and Plum. Green Living Organics, glo, believes in the simple concept of �do well by doing good�. With glo, you have the assurance that our bed, bath and baby products have been made in ways that are both socially and environmentally responsible. glo has a long-term commitment to sustainable farming. All our cotton is GOTS certified. It is grown and hand-picked by over 6,500 family farmers in five states in India, most practicing bio-dynamic growing methods which contribute to soil fertility and higher yields with the input of only natural fertilizers. This reduces costs and increases revenue for farmers while preventing contamination and poisoning from the use of pesticides, herbicides and synthetic fertilizers. The Fairtrade Certification Mark on our products is your independent guarantee that the cotton in this product has been certified in accordance with international Fairtrade Standards. The purchase of this product made with Fairtrade Certified Cotton enables the improvement of working and living conditions of Cotton Producers in developing countries and encourages environmental protection. Our Fairtrade ID (FLO ID) is 19996. Pls. go to info.fairtrade.net to find out more. Control Union certifies our goods are organic as per the Global Organic Textile Standard (GOTS). GOTS is the global standard for organic textiles from harvesting of the raw materials through environmentally and socially responsible manufacturing up to labeling. Our GOTS Certification No. is CU 818148. Pls. go to global-standard.org to find out more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rhGXOTAZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"glo","source_asin":"B00I9GCH6M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I9GCH6M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I9GCH6M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
