window.products.push({"id":923977,"name":"Wrestling Personalized Christmas Ornament - Male - Brown Hair - Handpainted Resin - 4\" Tall - Free Customization by Calliope Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wrvO7sdkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Give an ornament to the wrestler in your life! This Christmas ornament is made from cast resin. The material is similar to clay, but is lighter in weight. Then the front side of the ornament is carefully hand painted. The finish is a matt finish. The ornament comes with a ribbon for hanging on the Christmas tree and each item is designed to be personalized to your order. All personalization is done by hand by artists. While lettering style will vary from artists to artist, all lettering is done to our high standards of beauty and legibility, using permanent black ink. Always double check the spelling of each name as once the ornament is personalized we can’t change it! We know you’ll enjoy giving this hand painted and carefully personalized and dated Christmas ornament. It will be enjoyed for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wrvO7sdkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calliope Designs","source_asin":"B0194PSKYE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923977","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0194PSKYE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0194PSKYE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":923978,"name":"Blackout Cordless Bamboo Roman Blinds, Roll-Up Natural Woven Shades with 6\" H Valance, Custom Light Filtering Bamboo Shades for Windows, Doors, Patio ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8104czJoD1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"① DESCRIPTION: Bamboo window shades made by pieces of natural bamboo. Adding back liner (70% - 80% blackout) and no liner (no privacy avilable) for you to choose. It can be used indoor where it is not humid or outdoor but DO NOT expose to rainwater. Safe for children and pets. Our blinds and shades will help reduce heat in your room. ② MADE-TO-ORDER: We provide custom service to make sure you can receive correct shade size. Choosing the color and type you want. Hit the “customize now” button on the right side to fill out your custom measurements. Choosing mounting type, provide custom measurements. If your size is not found on the customize list, please select the closest size to process order. If you have questions. Add any optional additional comments. Then we will contact you in 24 hours to confirm the order details. ③ INTERNAL MOUNT: For an INSIDE the window frame mount, fill out the customization form with the exact measurement of the OPENING to the 1/16th inch and WE WILL TAKE A 0.4INCH deduction off the exact measurement given so the shade will fit perfectly in that opening. The shade must be slightly smaller than the opening to fit inside. Roller bamboo shade and roman bamboo shade both need 2\" depth for inside mount. Again, we take the deduction so give us the exact opening to the 1/16th inch. ④ EXTERNAL MOUNT: WE WILL NOT MAKE ANY ADJUSTMENT, so provide us with the exact shade size you want when filling out the customization form. Outside mount is traditionally mounted above the window opening and go slightly wider than the opening. Usually shades width need to be 3\" to 10\" wider than window width, shade height need to be 5\" to 10\" longer than window height for better coverage. All mounting hardware is included help you install the shade. ⑤ SHIPPING & SERVICE: Our window roller shade contains an accessory kit includingbracket,screws and install instruction for convenience.To make sure you receive the package quickly and correctly please reconfirm the shipping address. A kind reminder, BOX address is not available, so please provide your physical address. Before you place the order or after you received the package, any questions feel free to contact customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8104czJoD1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Facimi","source_asin":"B0BHZQ4DYL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-923978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZQ4DYL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZQ4DYL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
